{"version": 1, "pages": [{"id": "p1", "title": "1. Home · close (compare, Lucidchart, closing) · cycle 3", "shapes": [{"id": "doc-title-p1", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -860, "w": 4400, "h": 200}, "text": "<p style='font-size:40pt;text-align:left'><b>Harvest concept site · Cycle 3 review (preview 9f6f8db)</b><br><span style='font-size:20pt'>Home: compare, Lucidchart, closing · Desktop 1440×1024 · commit 9f6f8db · https://6ace5bda91107ed2c5b1d4c2--harvest-for-lucid.netlify.app</span></p>"}, {"id": "legend-box-p1", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -600, "w": 2600, "h": 420}, "text": "<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>How to review</b><br>Leave feedback as sticky notes INSIDE the screen's frame. Start a note with <b>Do:</b>, <b>Must do</b>, <b>Try:</b> or <b>Consider:</b> to set its priority (the words win over the colour); otherwise the colour counts: <span style='color:#C62828'><b>Red = Do / Must do</b></span>, <span style='color:#9A7B00'><b>Yellow = Try</b></span>, <span style='color:#1565C0'><b>Blue = Consider</b></span>. <span style='color:#BA23F6'><b>Purple = Board format</b></span> (notes about this board's layout). Comments are read as general feedback.<br><b>Stickies show your name — stay signed in.</b></p>"}, {"id": "legend-must-p1", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 2700, "y": -530, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FF8A80"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C62828", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Red</b><br>Do / Must do</p>"}, {"id": "legend-try-p1", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3020, "y": -530, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FFE066"}, "stroke": {"color": "#9A7B00", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Yellow</b><br>Try</p>"}, {"id": "legend-maybe-p1", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3340, "y": -530, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#A3E4FF"}, "stroke": {"color": "#1565C0", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Blue</b><br>Consider</p>"}, {"id": "legend-board-p1", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3660, "y": -530, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#BA23F6"}, "stroke": {"color": "#7B1FA2", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}, "textColor": "#FFFFFF"}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Purple</b><br>Board format</p>"}, {"id": "frame-home-09-compare", "type": "sparkFrame", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 2240, "h": 3468}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#F2F3F5"}, "stroke": {"color": "#F2F3F5", "width": 0, "style": "solid"}}, "customData": [{"key": "stepKey", "value": "home-09-compare"}, {"key": "route", "value": "/"}, {"key": "cycle", "value": "3"}, {"key": "flow", "value": "home-close"}], "title": "home-09-compare · / · Harvest | Lucid"}, {"id": "img-home-09-compare", "type": "image", "boundingBox": {"x": 400, "y": 400, "w": 1440, "h": 1024}, "image": {"type": "image", "url": "https://harvest-dashboard.netlify.app/captures/harvest-site/c3-home-close/01-home-09-compare.png"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C9CED8", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, {"id": "hdr-home-09-compare", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 400, "y": 1784, "w": 1440, "h": 200}, "text": "<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>1. home-09-compare</b>  ·  /<br><span style='font-size:16pt'>Harvest | Lucid  —  h1: “Every sticky note becomes a change”  —  scrolled to heading “Where Harvest fits” (y=6467)</span></p>"}, {"id": "changes-home-close-1", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 400, "y": 2044, "w": 1280, "h": 302}, "text": "<p style='font-size:20pt;text-align:left'><b>Changes in this cycle</b> (vs cycle 2)<br><br>• [try] Red ✕ on drawbacks, green ✓ on Harvest; cells rewritten in pros/cons style</p>"}, {"id": "before-lbl-home-close-1", "type": "text", "boundingB